      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `80a149e26d5387b51143f8e13f1d61c6f2e9377159cfb162d4ccd66c3f08e31e--criminal-courts-australia-2010-11-cube-6-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2010-11\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 6 of 6\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 140c5c99c2f9e11f8468df3a55fdc8ff82d1e1e8a84087594cdd8360532a57a7 | missing |\n| \"Table_1\" | 43c8d1be6463e2c9f844d4b12e4c7a45531463db67f597d563d579c7f22c6ed8 | missing |\n| \"Table_2\" | 0d221745d6ec11f78358b735c69a578bbc9a2cfa189d10ccf035be8fbce23899 | missing |\n| \"Table_3\" | 9b640ed06aa7b3443726c266cdba9a84573b94bc852260da3159078a3fb854ae | missing |\n| \"Table_4\" | 774bae6687394d65614a92d2a6d410a8c9b3dc91b679e3cefc97ee4c08f71ac7 | missing |\n| \"Table_5\" | 8a1823a39ebb212c4a5173ee50589be903261e9229bc308fa9cedcbc7b7f4c21 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- None\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
